OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome light
OL,6,Fand patchy rain will spread east early
OL,7,Fthis evening. Then the rest of the
OL,8,Fnight will be cloudy with some showery
OL,9,Frain, but fewer showers in the south.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FAfter a mainly dry start rain
OL,12,Fwill spread southeast, lingering
OL,13,Facross the south into the evening.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FRain
OL,16,Fspreading northeast on Wednesday.
OL,17,FBright spells and a few showers on
OL,18,FThursday. Further showers on Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
